[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4621.91, "timestamp": "01:17:01", "text": "虽然很疯狂，但感觉比这疯狂得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4625.75, "timestamp": "01:17:05", "text": "比第一次我相信的要好得多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4632.669, "timestamp": "01:17:12", "text": "好吧，这很奇怪，我会尽力，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4639.47, "timestamp": "01:17:19", "text": "你失去了一切，是的，只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4642.79, "timestamp": "01:17:22", "text": "我拥有的东西是Ving"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4650.91, "timestamp": "01:17:30", "text": "伙计们，我没办法把它藏起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4653.27, "timestamp": "01:17:33", "text": "反正也没人会找到，所以我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4656.59, "timestamp": "01:17:36", "text": "我也打算做完任务就回来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4659.11, "timestamp": "01:17:39", "text": "然后藏个秘密的地方什么的，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4661.59, "timestamp": "01:17:41", "text": "我拿不到末影箱之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4665.189, "timestamp": "01:17:45", "text": "不，因为下界被锁住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4670.47, "timestamp": "01:17:50", "text": "所以，嗯，好吧，你环顾四周。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4673.83, "timestamp": "01:17:53", "text": "我去看看能不能找到"}]